Input: {"question": "Who is the artist of the song \"Shy Boy\"?", "original_source_segments": {"D1S1": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0484-9471cb866110:d00", "start": 0, "end": 70, "text": "Shy Boy \"Shy Boy\" is a song recorded by English girl group Bananarama."}, "D1S2": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0484-9471cb866110:d00", "start": 71, "end": 165, "text": "It appears on their 1983 debut album \"Deep Sea Skiving\" and was released as its second single."}, "D1S3": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0484-9471cb866110:d00", "start": 166, "end": 337, "text": "It was written and produced by the production team of Steve Jolley and Tony Swain and marked the first in a long line of studio collaborations between them and Bananarama."}, "D1S4": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0484-9471cb866110:d00", "start": 338, "end": 588, "text": "The song is rumoured to be a tribute to teenaged London pirate radio comedian Mark Gould whom Bananarama subsequently demanded as their Christmas present for 1983 on the Christmas edition of BBC1's \"Show Business\" programme, which was broadcast on 16"}, "D2S1": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0484-9471cb866110:d01", "start": 0, "end": 93, "text": "Shy Boy (Secret song) \"Shy Boy\" (Korean: 샤이보이) is a single by South Korean girl group Secret."}, "D2S2": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0484-9471cb866110:d01", "start": 94, "end": 168, "text": "It is released as a CD single on January 6, 2011 through TS Entertainment."}, "D2S3": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0484-9471cb866110:d01", "start": 169, "end": 231, "text": "The song was written and produced by Kang Jiwon and Kim Kibum."}, "D2S4": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0484-9471cb866110:d01", "start": 232, "end": 316, "text": "It was remade with Japanese lyrics and was on Secret's first Japanese EP, \"Shy Boy\"."}, "D2S5": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0484-9471cb866110:d01", "start": 317, "end": 427, "text": "According to Gaon, \"Shy Boy\" has sold over 2,215,864 digital downloads in South Korea as of December 31, 2011."}, "D2S6": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0484-9471cb866110:d01", "start": 428, "end": 501, "text": "Secret released the teaser for their single \"Shy Boy\" on January 2, 2011."}, "D2S7": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0484-9471cb866110:d01", "start": 502, "end": 559, "text": "The single was released on music stores and digital music"}, "D3S1": {"document_number": 3, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0484-9471cb866110:d02", "start": 0, "end": 49, "text": "`` Gaon Search – Secret – 샤이보이 '' ( in Korean ) ."}, "D3S2": {"document_number": 3, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0484-9471cb866110:d02", "start": 50, "end": 56, "text": "Gaon ."}, "D3S3": {"document_number": 3, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0484-9471cb866110:d02", "start": 57, "end": 107, "text": "Archived from the original on February 11 , 2015 ."}, "D3S4": {"document_number": 3, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0484-9471cb866110:d02", "start": 108, "end": 134, "text": "Retrieved March 2 , 2012 ."}, "D3S5": {"document_number": 3, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0484-9471cb866110:d02", "start": 135, "end": 188, "text": "^ `` SECRET 's `` Shy Boy '' copies are sold out '' ."}, "D3S6": {"document_number": 3, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0484-9471cb866110:d02", "start": 189, "end": 195, "text": "Nate ."}, "D3S7": {"document_number": 3, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0484-9471cb866110:d02", "start": 196, "end": 225, "text": "Retrieved October 26 , 2011 ."}, "D3S8": {"document_number": 3, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0484-9471cb866110:d02", "start": 226, "end": 255, "text": "^ `` : : 가온차트와 함께하세요 : : '' ."}, "D3S9": {"document_number": 3, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0484-9471cb866110:d02", "start": 256, "end": 305, "text": "Archived from the original on January 19 , 2012 ."}, "D3S10": {"document_number": 3, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0484-9471cb866110:d02", "start": 306, "end": 334, "text": "Retrieved January 7 , 2012 ."}, "D3S11": {"document_number": 3, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0484-9471cb866110